  "reference": "Mwanzo 24",
  "verseCount": 67,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa Abrahamu alikuwa mzee wa miaka mingi, naye Mwenyezi-Mungu alikuwa amembariki katika kila hali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku moja Abrahamu akamwambia mtumishi wake aliyekuwa mzee kuliko wengine na msimamizi wa mali yake yote, “Weka mkono wako mapajani mwangu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nami nitakuapisha kwa jina la Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa mbingu na dunia, kwamba hutamwoza mwanangu msichana yeyote miongoni mwa binti za Wakanaani ninaoishi nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niapie kwamba utakwenda mpaka katika nchi yangu, kwa jamaa zangu, umtafutie mwanangu Isaka mke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtumishi akamwambia, “Huenda mwanamke huyo atakataa kufuatana nami kuja huku, ikiwa hivyo, je, ni lazima nimrudishe mwanao nchini ulikotoka?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu akamwambia, “La! Angalia sana usimrudishe mwanangu huko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa mbingu, aliyenitoa nyumbani kwa baba yangu na kutoka katika nchi nilimozaliwa, na ambaye alisema nami, aliniapia kwamba atawapa wazawa wangu nchi hii. Yeye atamtuma malaika wake mbele yako ili umletee mwanangu mke kutoka huko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwapo mwanamke huyo hatapenda kufuatana nawe hadi huku, basi kiapo changu hakitakufunga, lakini kwa vyovyote vile usimrudishe mwanangu huko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, mtumishi huyo akaweka mkono wake mapajani mwa Abrahamu, bwana wake, akaapa kuhusu jambo hilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, huyo mtumishi akachukua ngamia kumi wa bwana wake akaondoka akiwa na zawadi nzuri za kila aina. Akasafiri kwenda katika mji alimokaa Nahori, nchini Mesopotamia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alipowasili, aliwapigisha magoti ngamia wake kando ya kisima kilichokuwa nje ya mji. Ilikuwa jioni wakati ambapo wanawake huenda kisimani kuteka maji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akaomba, “Ee Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa bwana wangu Abrahamu, nakuomba unijalie nifaulu leo na umfadhili Abrahamu bwana wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko hapa kando ya kisima ambapo binti za wenyeji wa mji huja kuteka maji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, msichana nitakayemwambia atue mtungi wake wa maji anipatie maji ninywe, naye akanipa mimi pamoja na kuwanywesha ngamia wangu, na awe ndiye uliyemchagulia mtumishi wako Isaka. Jambo hilo litanionesha kwamba umemfadhili bwana wangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabla hajamaliza kuomba, mara Rebeka, binti Bethueli, mwana wa Milka, mkewe Nahori, ndugu yake Abrahamu, akafika amebeba mtungi wake begani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msichana huyo alikuwa na sura ya kuvutia sana, na bikira ambaye hakuwa amelala na mwanamume yeyote. Basi, akateremka kisimani, akaujaza mtungi wake maji na kupanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo yule mtumishi akaharakisha kukutana naye, akamwambia, “Tafadhali, nipatie maji ya kunywa kutoka mtungi wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msichana akamjibu, “Haya kunywa bwana wangu.” Na papo hapo akautua mtungi wake, akiushikilia ili amnyweshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alipokwisha kumpatia maji, akamwambia, “Nitawatekea maji ngamia wako pia, wanywe mpaka watosheke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, akafanya haraka, akawamiminia ngamia maji ya mtungi wake katika hori, akakimbia kisimani kuteka maji mengine na kuwanywesha ngamia wake wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mtu akawa anamtazama kwa makini bila kusema lolote, apate kufahamu kama Mwenyezi-Mungu ameifanikisha safari yake au sivyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngamia walipotosheka kunywa maji, yule mtu akampa huyo msichana pete ya dhahabu yenye uzito upatao gramu sita, na bangili mbili za dhahabu za gramu kumi kila moja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamwuliza, “Niambie tafadhali: Wewe ni binti nani? Je, kuna nafasi ya kulala nyumbani kwenu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rebeka akajibu, “Mimi ni binti Bethueli, mwana wa Milka, mkewe Nahori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwetu kuna majani na malisho ya kutosha na mahali pa kulala wageni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo yule mtu akainamisha kichwa chake, akamwabudu Mwenyezi-Mungu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akisema, “Atukuzwe Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa bwana wangu Abrahamu, ambaye hajasahau fadhili zake na uaminifu wake kwa bwana wangu. Mwenyezi-Mungu ameniongoza mimi mwenyewe moja kwa moja hadi kwa jamaa ya bwana wangu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha yule msichana akakimbia kwenda kuwapa habari jamaa za mama yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rebeka alikuwa na kaka yake aitwaye Labani. Labani akatoka mbio kukutana na yule mtu kisimani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani alikuwa ameiona ile pete na bangili mikononi mwa dada yake, na kusikia mambo Rebeka aliyoambiwa na huyo mtu. Labani alimkuta yule mtu amesimama karibu na ngamia wake kando ya kisima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani akamwambia, “Karibu kwetu wewe uliyebarikiwa na Mwenyezi-Mungu. Mbona unasimama nje? Mimi mwenyewe nimekwisha tayarisha nyumba na mahali kwa ajili ya hawa ngamia wako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, mtumishi huyo wa Abrahamu akaingia nyumbani. Labani akawafungua ngamia na kuwapatia majani ngamia wake, akampa yeye na watu wake maji ya kunawa miguu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, wakamwandalia chakula, lakini yeye akasema, “Sitakula mpaka nimesema ninachotaka kusema.” Labani akamwambia, “Haya, tuambie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mtu akasema, “Mimi ni mtumishi wa Abrahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu amembariki sana bwana wangu, naye amekuwa mtu maarufu. Amempa makundi ya kondoo na mifugo mingi, fedha na dhahabu, watumishi wa kiume na wa kike, ngamia na punda! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sara, mke wa bwana wangu katika uzee wake, alimzalia bwana wangu mtoto; na bwana wangu amempa huyo mtoto mali yake yote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwana wangu aliniapisha mimi akisema, ‘Hutamwoza mwanangu msichana yeyote miongoni mwa binti za Wakanaani ambao ninaishi katika nchi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bali utakwenda mpaka nchi yangu, kwa jamaa zangu, ili umtafutie mwanangu Isaka mke.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nikamwambia bwana wangu, ‘Huenda mwanamke huyo akakataa kufuatana nami kuja huku.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini yeye akasema, ‘Mwenyezi-Mungu aniongozaye maishani mwangu, atamtuma malaika wake aende pamoja nawe na kukufanikisha katika safari yako; nawe utamtwalia mwanangu mke kutoka kwa jamaa yangu na nyumba ya baba yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama utakapofika kwa jamaa zangu hawatakupa huyo msichana, basi, hutafungwa na kiapo changu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Leo nilipofika kisimani nimeomba, ‘Ee Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa bwana wangu Abrahamu, nakuomba nifaulu leo katika safari yangu na umfadhili Abrahamu bwana wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko hapa kando ya kisima. Msichana atakayekuja kuteka maji ambaye nitamwomba anipatie maji kidogo ya kunywa kutoka mtungi wake, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye akanipa na kuwatekea maji ngamia wangu, basi huyo na awe ndiye uliyemchagua kuwa mke wa mwana wa bwana wangu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabla sijamaliza kuomba moyoni mwangu, mara Rebeka alifika na mtungi wake wa maji begani, akateremka kisimani na kuteka maji. Nami nikamwambia, ‘Tafadhali nipe maji ya kunywa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akautua mtungi wake haraka kutoka begani mwake, akasema, ‘Haya, kunywa bwana wangu. Nitawatekea maji ngamia wako pia.’ Basi mimi nikanywa na ngamia wangu pia akawapa maji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo nilipomwuliza, ‘Je, wewe ni binti wa nani?’ Akaniambia, ‘Mimi ni binti wa Bethueli, mwana wa Milka, mkewe Nahori.’ Ndipo nilipompa pete na kumvisha bangili mikononi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha nikainama na kumwabudu Mwenyezi-Mungu; nikamtukuza Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa bwana wangu Abrahamu, ambaye ameniongoza moja kwa moja kwa binti wa ukoo wa bwana wangu kwa ajili ya mwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa, basi, niambieni kama mko tayari kumtendea bwana wangu kwa uaminifu na haki; kama sivyo, basi semeni, nami nitajua cha kufanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya kusikia hayo, Labani na Bethueli wakamjibu, “Jambo hili limetoka kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, sisi hatuwezi kuamua lolote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rebeka huyu hapa; mchukue uende. Na awe mke wa mwana wa bwana wako kama Mwenyezi-Mungu alivyosema.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtumishi wa Abrahamu aliposikia maneno hayo, alimsujudia Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha akatoa vito vya fedha na dhahabu na nguo, akampa Rebeka. Pia aliwapa ndugu na mama yake Rebeka mapambo ya thamani kubwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtumishi wa Abrahamu na watu aliokuja nao wakala, wakanywa na kulala huko. Walipoamka asubuhi, mtumishi yule akasema, “Naomba kurudi kwa bwana wangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini ndugu na mama yake Rebeka wakasema, “Mwache msichana akae nasi muda mfupi, kama siku kumi hivi; kisha anaweza kwenda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini yeye akasema, “Tafadhali, msinicheleweshe, kwa kuwa Mwenyezi-Mungu amekwisha fanikisha safari yangu; naomba mniruhusu kurudi kwa bwana wangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wakasema, “Basi, tumwite msichana mwenyewe, tumwulize.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamwita Rebeka na kumwuliza, “Je, utakwenda na mtu huyu?” Naye akajibu, “Nitakwenda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, wakamwacha Rebeka na yaya wake aende na mtumishi wa Abrahamu na watu wake. Yaya wake Rebeka pia aliandamana naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, wakambariki Rebeka wakisema,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.60"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
